      <section class="block" id="pain">
        <div class="eyebrow"><span lang-zh>问题陈述</span><span lang-en>Problem statement</span></div>
        <h2 class="section-title">
          <span lang-zh>用户面临的<em>四个挑战</em></span>
          <span lang-en>The four <em>challenges users face</em>.</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="section-lead">
          <span lang-zh>Claude Code 调用的是 Opus / Sonnet 这类顶级模型，单次复杂任务可能消耗数美元至数十美元。当团队规模化使用，下列四个挑战立刻浮现——它们恰好与本方案的四条主线一一对应：</span>
          <span lang-en>Claude Code runs on Opus / Sonnet — a single complex task can cost a few to tens of dollars. As team usage scales, four challenges surface — each maps to one of our four OKR mainlines:</span>
        </p>
        <div class="grid-2">
          <div class="pain-card">
            <div class="icon">$</div>
            <h4><span lang-zh>成本不可见、不可控</span><span lang-en>Cost is opaque &amp; uncontrolled</span></h4>
            <ul>
              <li><span lang-zh><b>单价高昂</b> — Opus / Sonnet 顶级模型，单次复杂任务可耗 <b>数美元至数十美元</b></span><span lang-en><b>Pricey models</b> — Opus / Sonnet at top tier; a single complex task can burn <b>several to tens of dollars</b>.</span></li>
              <li><span lang-zh><b>归因缺失</b> — 谁在用、用得多狠、花在什么任务上、ROI 如何，<b>完全没有数据</b></span><span lang-en><b>Zero attribution</b> — who uses it, how heavily, on what tasks, with what ROI: <b>no data at all</b>.</span></li>
              <li><span lang-zh><b>账单滞后</b> — 月底几万美金账单一来，<b>无法解释也无法优化</b></span><span lang-en><b>Mystery bill</b> — a five-figure invoice arrives month-end, <b>no way to explain or optimize</b>.</span></li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="pain-card">
            <div class="icon">?</div>
            <h4><span lang-zh>收益不可量化</span><span lang-en>Value can't be measured</span></h4>
            <ul>
              <li><span lang-zh><b>价值质询</b> — 老板与财务问：买了 Claude Code，<b>到底提效多少？值不值？</b></span><span lang-en><b>The hard question</b> — finance asks: we bought Claude Code, <b>how much faster? worth it?</b></span></li>
              <li><span lang-zh><b>主观判断</b> — 没有数据就只能说"<b>大家都说挺好用的</b>"，汇报上站不住脚</span><span lang-en><b>Gut feel only</b> — without data, the answer is "<b>everyone says it's nice</b>" — won't survive a review.</span></li>
              <li><span lang-zh><b>指标体系待建</b> — DAU / WAU、人均会话数、人均 token、高频使用场景，<b>这些指标本可拿出来</b></span><span lang-en><b>Could be quantified</b> — DAU / WAU, sessions per user, tokens per user, top scenarios: <b>all should be visible</b>.</span></li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="pain-card">
            <div class="icon">⚠</div>
            <h4><span lang-zh>质量与安全不可见</span><span lang-en>Quality &amp; safety are invisible</span></h4>
            <ul>
              <li><span lang-zh><b>行为不透明</b> — Claude Code 执行 bash、改文件、调 MCP，<b>到底做了什么？访问了哪些敏感文件？有没有把代码传出去？</b></span><span lang-en><b>Execution blackbox</b> — Claude Code runs bash, edits files, calls MCP. <b>What ran? Which sensitive files? Did code leave the host?</b></span></li>
              <li><span lang-zh><b>审计无据</b> — 误删文件、泄露数据等问题发生后，<b>没有审计日志可查</b></span><span lang-en><b>No post-mortem</b> — when something leaks or breaks, <b>no audit trail exists</b>.</span></li>
              <li><span lang-zh><b>合规失能</b> — 合规、安全、法务的问题，<b>现在都答不上来</b></span><span lang-en><b>Compliance can't answer</b> — questions from compliance, security, legal: <b>all unanswered today</b>.</span></li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="pain-card">
            <div class="icon">↻</div>
            <h4><span lang-zh>经验无法沉淀</span><span lang-en>Expertise can't be inherited</span></h4>
            <ul>
              <li><span lang-zh><b>依赖个体</b> — 团队某个高手用得特别好，但他的"姿势"和 prompt 套路<b>留不下来</b></span><span lang-en><b>Lone hero</b> — one person uses Claude Code brilliantly, but their stance and prompt patterns <b>can't be captured</b>.</span></li>
              <li><span lang-zh><b>数据闲置</b> — Trace 里其实藏着<b>哪些场景效果最好、哪些 prompt 模式最有效</b>的答案</span><span lang-en><b>Data sits idle</b> — traces actually contain <b>which scenarios work best and which prompt patterns repeat</b>.</span></li>
              <li><span lang-zh><b>复用断链</b> — 想把高手经验反哺给整个团队，<b>现在还做不到</b></span><span lang-en><b>Feedback loop missing</b> — feeding the expert's playbook back to the team: <b>not yet possible</b>.</span></li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="block" id="value">
        <div class="eyebrow"><span lang-zh>能力补充</span><span lang-en>Gap fill</span></div>
        <h2 class="section-title">
          <span lang-zh>Langfuse 对 Claude Code 的<em>可观测性补充</em></span>
          <span lang-en>What <em>Langfuse adds</em> to Claude Code observability</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="section-lead">
          <span lang-zh>Claude Code Console 提供基础的 token 与计费视图，但在多维归因、任务评估、审计取证、经验沉淀四个维度均存在能力缺口。Langfuse 沿这四条线，将 Claude Code 的可观测性从「账单级」升级到「工程治理级」。</span>
          <span lang-en>Claude Code Console gives basic token and billing views, but leaves gaps in multi-dim attribution, task evaluation, audit forensics, and knowledge legacy. Langfuse fills those four lines — taking Claude Code observability from <i>billing-grade</i> to <i>engineering-governance-grade</i>.</span>
        </p>
        <div class="grid-2">
          <div class="value-card">
            <span class="tag">价值一 · 成本精细化管控 · 对应挑战 1</span>
            <div class="icon">$</div>
            <h4><span lang-zh>成本精细化管控</span><span lang-en>Granular cost control</span></h4>
            <ul>
              <li><span lang-zh><b>多维归因</b> — 按用户 / 团队 / 项目 / 模型 / 任务类型五维切片（Console 只到 Key 维度，<span class="hit">287 Key 时失效</span>）</span><span lang-en><b>Multi-dim attribution</b> — slice by user / team / project / model / task type. Console only goes to Key level, <span class="hit">breaks at ~287 Keys</span>.</span></li>
              <li><span lang-zh><b>浪费识别</b> — LLM-as-Judge 自动识别 5 类浪费：Opus 做简单任务、Context 膨胀、Cache 未命中、任务未拆分、工具调用冗余</span><span lang-en><b>Waste detection</b> — LLM-as-Judge auto-detects 5 patterns: Opus on simple tasks, context bloat, cache misses, unsplit tasks, redundant tool calls.</span></li>
              <li><span lang-zh><b>预算与告警</b> — 异常消费告警、月预算 80/100% 预警、ROI 与效能分析（Console 均不支持）</span><span lang-en><b>Budget &amp; alerts</b> — anomaly alerts, 80%/100% monthly budget alerts, ROI &amp; efficiency analytics (Console: none).</span></li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="value-card">
            <span class="tag">价值二 · 效能度量 · 对应挑战 2</span>
            <div class="icon">∑</div>
            <h4><span lang-zh>效能度量</span><span lang-en>Productivity measurement</span></h4>
            <ul>
              <li><span lang-zh><b>使用画像</b> — 日活 / 周活、人均会话数、人均 token、任务时长分布，原始数据齐备，Dashboard 即拼即用</span><span lang-en><b>Usage profile</b> — DAU / WAU, sessions per user, tokens per user, task duration. Raw data ready; dashboard composable on demand.</span></li>
              <li><span lang-zh><b>任务分类</b> — LLM-as-Judge 标准化打标（写测试 / 重构 / 排查 bug / 写文档 …），所有 session 自动归类</span><span lang-en><b>Task classification</b> — LLM-as-Judge standard tags (test / refactor / debug / doc …); every session auto-labeled.</span></li>
              <li><span lang-zh><b>ROI 可量化</b> — 把"提效"从主观感觉转为数字：人均 token、Top 高频场景、任务完成率；接入 Git / Jira 可对比"用 AI 的 PR vs 不用"</span><span lang-en><b>Quantifiable ROI</b> — convert "productivity gain" from gut feel to numbers: tokens per user, top scenarios, task completion rate. With Git / Jira hookup, compare AI vs Non-AI PRs.</span></li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="value-card">
            <span class="tag">价值三 · 合规与安全审计 · 对应挑战 3</span>
            <div class="icon">⚐</div>
            <h4><span lang-zh>合规与安全审计</span><span lang-en>Compliance &amp; security audit</span></h4>
            <ul>
              <li><span lang-zh><b>完整审计日志</b> — 每次执行了什么命令、读了什么文件、调了哪些 MCP——<span class="hit">毫秒级时间戳</span>全量留存</span><span lang-en><b>Full audit trail</b> — every command, file read, MCP call captured with <span class="hit">millisecond timestamps</span>.</span></li>
              <li><span lang-zh><b>敏感操作告警</b> — 自动检测 <code>.env</code> 读取、<code>rm -rf</code>、外部 API 调用、生产数据库操作</span><span lang-en><b>Sensitive-op alerts</b> — auto-detect <code>.env</code> reads, <code>rm -rf</code>, external API calls, prod DB operations.</span></li>
              <li><span lang-zh><b>合规对齐</b> — 满足 ISO27001、SOC2、内审对 AI 工具的审计要求；外泄风险（敏感读取 + 外发）自动识别</span><span lang-en><b>Compliance alignment</b> — meets ISO27001, SOC2, internal-audit requirements for AI tooling; exfiltration risk (sensitive read + egress) auto-flagged.</span></li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="value-card">
