            <p class="step-desc"><span lang-zh>三项组件部署至宿主机：环境变量、Bash wrapper、Python translator。Claude Code 启动时读取 <code>/etc/claude-code/cc-langfuse.env</code> 并触发 Stop hook。</span><span lang-en>Three pieces land on the host: env file, Bash wrapper, Python translator. Claude Code reads <code>/etc/claude-code/cc-langfuse.env</code> and fires the Stop hook.</span></p>
<pre class="code"><span class="cm"># <span lang-zh>1. 环境变量（含 Langfuse public_key / secret_key / host）</span><span lang-en>1. Env (langfuse pub/sec keys + host)</span></span>
<span class="kw">sudo</span> install <span class="fl">-m 640</span> cc-langfuse.env /etc/claude-code/cc-langfuse.env

<span class="cm"># <span lang-zh>2. Bash wrapper —— 负责身份兜底链与 venv 激活</span><span lang-en>2. Bash wrapper — identity fallback + venv activation</span></span>
<span class="kw">sudo</span> install <span class="fl">-m 755</span> cc-langfuse-wrapper.sh /usr/local/bin/cc-langfuse-wrapper.sh

<span class="cm"># <span lang-zh>3. Python translator —— Hook JSON → Langfuse SDK</span><span lang-en>3. Python translator — Hook JSON → Langfuse SDK</span></span>
<span class="kw">sudo</span> mkdir <span class="fl">-p</span> /usr/local/lib/cc-langfuse
<span class="kw">sudo</span> install <span class="fl">-m 644</span> langfuse_hook.py /usr/local/lib/cc-langfuse/

<span class="cm"># <span lang-zh>4. 在 Claude Code 的全局配置注册 Stop/SubagentStop hook</span><span lang-en>4. Register Stop/SubagentStop hook in Claude Code global config</span></span>
<span class="kw">claude</span> config set hooks.Stop <span class="st">"/usr/local/bin/cc-langfuse-wrapper.sh"</span>
<span class="kw">claude</span> config set hooks.SubagentStop <span class="st">"/usr/local/bin/cc-langfuse-wrapper.sh"</span></pre>
          </div>

          <div class="step" id="step-4">
            <div class="step-eyebrow"><span lang-zh>步骤 04 · 配置 8 个 Evaluator</span><span lang-en>Step 04 · Configure 8 evaluators</span></div>
            <h3>LLM-as-Judge <span lang-zh>从 0 到 8</span><span lang-en>from 0 to 8</span></h3>
            <p class="step-desc"><span lang-zh>评判模型默认 <code>claude-opus-4-6</code>。8 个评估器分为两类：分类型（task_type / risk_level / completion_state / exfiltration_intent）与打分型（quality_score / task_complexity / prompt_quality / COMPLETENESS）。</span><span lang-en>Default judge: <code>claude-opus-4-6</code>. 8 evaluators in two camps: classification (task_type / risk_level / completion_state / exfiltration_intent) and scoring (quality_score / task_complexity / prompt_quality / COMPLETENESS).</span></p>
<pre class="code"><span class="cm"># <span lang-zh>通过 Langfuse UI · Evaluators · 批量导入</span><span lang-en>Via Langfuse UI · Evaluators · bulk import</span></span>
<span class="pn">[</span>
  <span class="st">"task_type"</span>,            <span class="cm">// 8 categories</span>
  <span class="st">"task_complexity"</span>,      <span class="cm">// simple / medium / hard</span>
  <span class="st">"quality_score"</span>,        <span class="cm">// 1..5</span>
  <span class="st">"risk_level"</span>,           <span class="cm">// safe / caution / blocked</span>
  <span class="st">"completion_state"</span>,
  <span class="st">"prompt_quality"</span>,
  <span class="st">"exfiltration_intent"</span>,  <span class="cm">// <span lang-zh>真实命中 KR 3.3</span><span lang-en>real-hit KR 3.3</span></span>
  <span class="st">"COMPLETENESS"</span>
<span class="pn">]</span></pre>
          </div>

          <div class="step" id="step-5">
            <div class="step-eyebrow"><span lang-zh>步骤 05 · Grafana 5 块预置看板</span><span lang-en>Step 05 · Provision 5 dashboards</span></div>
            <h3><span lang-zh>导入 JSON，直接用</span><span lang-en>Import JSON, ready to use</span></h3>
            <p class="step-desc"><span lang-zh>5 个 dashboard JSON 取自 Git 仓库 <code>/opt/git/claude-langfuse/grafana/</code>。数据源类型为 ClickHouse，连接 Langfuse 内置 ClickHouse 实例（默认内网 :8123）。</span><span lang-en>5 dashboard JSON live in <code>/opt/git/claude-langfuse/grafana/</code>. Data source: ClickHouse, pointed at the Langfuse-bundled instance (default :8123 internal).</span></p>
<pre class="code"><span class="cm"># <span lang-zh>5 块看板（左侧文件名 · 右侧 Grafana 中显示名）</span><span lang-en>5 dashboards (file → display name)</span></span>
claude-my-usage.json            <span class="cm"># People &amp; Adoption</span>
claude-cost-effectiveness.json  <span class="cm"># Cost &amp; Effectiveness</span>
claude-governance-audit.json    <span class="cm"># Governance &amp; Audit</span>
claude-ops-reliability.json     <span class="cm"># Operations &amp; Reliability</span>
claude-team-roi.json            <span class="cm"># <span lang-zh>团队对标（暂归入 People &amp; Adoption）</span><span lang-en>team benchmark (rolled into People &amp; Adoption)</span></span>

<span class="cm"># <span lang-zh>批量导入</span><span lang-en>Bulk import</span></span>
