  <span class="kw">curl</span> <span class="fl">-X</span> POST http://admin:&lt;pwd&gt;@localhost:3001/api/dashboards/db \
       <span class="fl">-H</span> <span class="st">"Content-Type: application/json"</span> <span class="fl">-d</span> @<span class="st">"$f"</span>
<span class="kw">done</span></pre>
          </div>

          <div class="step" id="step-6">
            <div class="step-eyebrow"><span lang-zh>步骤 06 · 用户身份兜底链</span><span lang-en>Step 06 · User identity fallback</span></div>
            <h3><span lang-zh>三级兜底：env → git → whoami</span><span lang-en>Three-tier fallback: env → git → whoami</span></h3>
            <p class="step-desc"><span lang-zh>身份信息是所有分析的根基。Wrapper 按序解析：<code>$CC_LANGFUSE_USER</code> 环境变量 → 当前目录 <code>git config user.email</code> → <code>whoami</code>；三层全部失败方落入 <code>unknown</code>。</span><span lang-en>Identity is the root key for analytics. Wrapper resolves in order: <code>$CC_LANGFUSE_USER</code> env → repo-local <code>git config user.email</code> → <code>whoami</code>. Falls back to <code>unknown</code> only if all three miss.</span></p>
<pre class="code"><span class="cm"># cc-langfuse-wrapper.sh <span lang-zh>核心片段</span><span lang-en>core snippet</span></span>
<span class="kw">resolve_user</span>() <span class="pn">{</span>
  <span class="kw">if</span> [[ <span class="fl">-n</span> <span class="st">"$CC_LANGFUSE_USER"</span> ]]; <span class="kw">then</span>
    <span class="kw">echo</span> <span class="st">"$CC_LANGFUSE_USER"</span>; <span class="kw">return</span>
  <span class="kw">fi</span>
  <span class="kw">local</span> email=$(<span class="kw">git</span> config user.email <span class="nu">2</span>&gt;/dev/null)
  <span class="kw">if</span> [[ <span class="fl">-n</span> <span class="st">"$email"</span> ]]; <span class="kw">then</span>
    <span class="kw">echo</span> <span class="st">"$email"</span>; <span class="kw">return</span>
  <span class="kw">fi</span>
  <span class="kw">whoami</span>
<span class="pn">}</span></pre>
